      "foaf:name": "Ocean Knowledge Base",
      "sdo:name": "Ocean Knowledge Base",
      "sdo:description": "In a joint effort \"Springer Natureâ€, the \"German Ocean Foundationâ€, the \"German Society for Marine Researchâ€ and the \"VBIO - Verband Biologie, Biowissenschaften & Biomedizin in Deutschlandâ€ would like to establish a project where we try to reach out to non-scientists like political decision makers, journalists, and the public and help them find, easily access and recombine the information they need from Springer Nature as a publisher.",
