      ],
      "foaf:name": "COESSING West Africa school",
      "sdo:name": "COESSING West Africa school",
      "sdo:description": "Based upon our experience in Peace Corps, the Coastal Ocean Environment Summer School in Ghana (https://coessing.org), would inspire large numbers of scientists, especially early-career scientists, into its ranks, thus \"internationalizingâ€ their outlook, molding many of them into champions for international capacity development for the remainder of their careers, and fostering true ocean science collaborations worldwide.",
