      "foaf:name": "Explore the strongest ocean current in the Western Pacific: the 2nd Cooperative Study of Kuroshio and Adjacent Regions – from its sciences to human well beings",
      "sdo:name": "Explore the strongest ocean current in the Western Pacific: the 2nd Cooperative Study of Kuroshio and Adjacent Regions – from its sciences to human well beings",
      "sdo:description": "The Kuroshio is the strongest current in the Western Pacific, with significant environmental, social and economic values.  The CSK2 will understand its changing conditions in global warming, and develop knowledge and services to serve societal needs, including, but not limited to, weather forecasts and climate predictions, fishery and aquaculture management.",
