      "foaf:name": "Southern University of Science and Technology (SUSTech) and the Preparing Shenzhen Ocean University (SOU)",
      "sdo:name": "Southern University of Science and Technology (SUSTech) and the Preparing Shenzhen Ocean University (SOU)",
      "sdo:description": "The Southern University of Science and Technology (SUSTech) is a public university located in Shenzhen, China with a commitment to establishing a world-leading oceanography program.",
