      "sdo:name": "Monitoring ecological resilience in Northern Fisheries inshore regions through community-based environmental genomics",
      "sdo:description": "Focused on eDNA technologies, this project will conduct a baseline biodiversity assessment, inform habitat models for key economic species, and empower local communities to get involved in their own biodiversity management through citizen science approaches and student training via co-op programming.  A framework will be developed to support future collaboration and research.",
