      "foaf:name": "Mitigating tsunamis' threat and destructive impact on coastal communities through enhanced navigation satellite system to tsunami early warnings",
      "sdo:name": "Mitigating tsunamis' threat and destructive impact on coastal communities through enhanced navigation satellite system to tsunami early warnings",
      "sdo:description": "Dr Michela Ravanelli's research will leverage a set of algorithms and develop a tool based on global navigation satellite system (GNSS) to improve the reliability, accuracy and rapidity of real-time tsunami warning systems lever.",
